73391845_2022791841535994_6381591123241693989_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5PKkbIS9NUQ7kNvwF8tWZv&_nc_oc=Adqetp-5-gnMwIRee9JGjfQE02-HcVJcZuxa4UVvlzuTAuRXFB5SSlAaVV_JuX0xi6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIMdAqApkUSNE3Iq85PbQ-AWpE5miZcfOhiEoZsd-Jb3w&oe=6AAEA869"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "650141244188879", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391716_650141250855545_8040660470448703299_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n5KSfe-DxOsQ7kNvwFbZmiB&_nc_oc=AdoFDt0RjKIJqb_OuY3ddJExSj5fzmdYj_RPfBRUlvNwZ8WSkVg453OTFpEF4In45zs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQILOARlHaj7pCshnXStn49geV9Qa-tLzpyE9tyj79YSKg&oe=6AAE8700"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "659135163455703", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393463_659135170122369_7227157406125140691_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vKCwF25h29sQ7kNvwHTFNfU&_nc_oc=Adovefk3FpkZsfJlChjMAFS1qMu5ES4_ahzY7DthZOcs977kMrvPyPehPdnj64Wpk1Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK-0xX-7PTemknJvsymn5umwz_WuAvEVlL0P_cEYDWuow&oe=6AAEA064"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1303847337568193", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393059_1303847340901526_2938449234628070226_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0bdhh259SRUQ7kNvwESgVZj&_nc_oc=Adq-MZ3xxj5y9bldNK-PbaEE90m0XqlCoXdcZduK0FyjWoWilteUb5YkdomXQovVBx8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCjZumbiX8PIwIeofKx3ltiZPDWlQKFFNI2pQQuuLeFw&oe=6AAE8BEA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PosterVideoTriler.png", "id": "2298977923791758", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391888_2298977927125091_343536883905062208_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vBUhudcYpW0Q7kNvwH-F3Xp&_nc_oc=AdqXbs6L412sVhJVQa_95QVC_qgTPI6yUouQdAbLM_Kass5GKt-3bhfMfs7PMquMmjc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJGbnAJOU0WhzIMbksxlyhJjCVq_iDmwP8LrKFgDgHE7Q&oe=6AAE9DF8"}, "display_name": "Hellfire Rampage", "keywords": ["Fighting", "shooter", "Action", "demons", "combat"], "long_description": "HELLFIRE RAMPAGE VR is an action-based combat game that blends shooting and melee fighting mechanics.\n\nYou are a genius portal inventor who has detected an abnormal signal from another world.\nAfter investigating, you discover that hellish creatures are collecting magical crystal essences and preparing to invade the HUMANITY\n\n-> YOUR MISSION IS TO STOP THEIR INVASION AND COLLECT THE CRYSTALS !\n\nUse your ability to slow time and take on powerful enemies in intense battles.\n[BULLET TIME + DASH] is a toxic combination for tactical movements and survival.\n\n-> REFLECT BULLETS BACK BY RICOCHET WITH ANY WEAPON\n\nCombine a magic wand with a talisman or a shotgun with a sickle.\nLaunch fireballs, swing a lightsaber, throw shurikens, or even play a demonic kalimba.\nThe arsenal is packed with epic gear, from chainsaws to crossbows and beyond!\nGet ready to test around 30+ non-trivial guns!\n\n\nFace dangerous hordes and destroy their source.\nPrepare to meet skeletons, imps, demons, hellhounds and mad ravens,\nundead summon kings, skull queens, giant devils, toxic moths and others...\n\n-> HELL CREATURES WILL NOT LET YOU TO GET BORED!\n\nThe most thrilling and intense fights are waiting for you.\n\nAround 70+ challenges from different mysterious locations\n\n-> GET READY TO SWEAT IN MORTAL CHALLENGES\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Are you brave enough to challenge the HELL?", "short_description": "Hellfire Rampage VR - true and hot battle against hordes of demons!\n\n- Find magical essences to boost your power.\n- Use slow-motion and dash jumps to destroy enemies.\n- Try over 30 epic and unique weapons.\n- Face terrifying hellish creatures with their own combat mechanics.\n\nYou are humanity\u2019s last hope - defeat the undead army and survive!"}]}, "de